     select '8229bac1-5be2-45be-b7b2-2041dce2a560', id, '0f42ea3b-28d9-46ec-8aaa-7d8f615308b3', 'Welcome to threadmoor: read this first', 'Welcome in. threadmoor is a place to show your work, ask questions, and argue politely about finishes. A few things that keep it pleasant: Post photos. A picture of the joint is worth ten paragraphs about it. Help topics', true, false, now() - interval '5011200 seconds', now() - interval '5011200 seconds'
       from categories where slug = 'projects';
     values ('0f8b74f1-4a54-4192-be71-9fb536f9c5f0', '8229bac1-5be2-45be-b7b2-2041dce2a560', '0f42ea3b-28d9-46ec-8aaa-7d8f615308b3', 'Welcome in. threadmoor is a place to show your work, ask questions, and argue politely about finishes.

A few things that keep it pleasant:

- **Post photos.** A picture of the joint is worth ten paragraphs about it.
- **Help topics get a solution.** If an answer fixed your problem, mark it so the next person finds it.
- **Be kind to beginners.** Everyone here once glued a drawer in upside down.

Follow a topic to get a daily digest of new replies. Markdown works everywhere, including images.', true, now() - interval '5011200 seconds');
     values ('b18896a9-d1d7-46d3-9670-71dc7570dc56', '8229bac1-5be2-45be-b7b2-2041dce2a560', 'e36648ad-ae34-420b-8177-6eff2bb3ad5b', 'Glad to be here. Forty years of teaching and I still learn something every time someone posts a glue-up disaster.', null, now() - interval '4267314 seconds');
     values ('5cc2e349-fd26-4107-969f-81bd779fb581', '8229bac1-5be2-45be-b7b2-2041dce2a560', '3916339e-7bd6-43db-a5eb-5f518f9fc522', 'Thanks Marta. I''ll be the one asking the daft questions in Help.', null, now() - interval '3179538 seconds');
     values ('ebef6a32-9ffe-42f1-8a65-0c12446f59ec', '8229bac1-5be2-45be-b7b2-2041dce2a560', '0f42ea3b-28d9-46ec-8aaa-7d8f615308b3', 'There are no daft questions, Leo. Only undersized tenons.', '5cc2e349-fd26-4107-969f-81bd779fb581', now() - interval '1908328 seconds');
     select '1cba5d73-bfe2-49d7-bf9c-38d9789ee432', id, '62531dae-f44b-4748-a0d9-0bada8b21385', 'Hall table from a 1920s bleacher seat', 'Finally finished the hall table I started in the spring. The top is a single bleacher plank from a high school gym that was being torn down. Still has the old seat numbers stamped on the underside. It''s not actually waln', false, false, now() - interval '276480 seconds', now() - interval '276480 seconds'
       from categories where slug = 'projects';
     values ('8bc4dc28-e4f6-407d-a333-e880401cb4b3', '1cba5d73-bfe2-49d7-bf9c-38d9789ee432', '62531dae-f44b-4748-a0d9-0bada8b21385', 'Finally finished the hall table I started in the spring. The top is a single bleacher plank from a high school gym that was being torn down. Still has the old seat numbers stamped on the underside.

![walnut slab with a maple butterfly](/media/f2956bd5-8ace-4997-afb6-459ed555381c/d578d3244a7adc28732c26505c5c60b1a29bc1e2b55dd110f4ce7de8ab547875)

It''s not actually walnut, it''s old growth fir that went dark over ninety years. The butterfly is maple, cut by hand. Legs are white oak with a drawbored mortise and tenon.

Finish is three coats of Osmo. Happy to share the cut list.', true, now() - interval '276480 seconds');
     values ('5c065ae9-ab16-4307-97ec-2f455b166c0a', '1cba5d73-bfe2-49d7-bf9c-38d9789ee432', '0f42ea3b-28d9-46ec-8aaa-7d8f615308b3', 'That''s a beautiful piece of timber. Drawbored legs on a hall table is exactly the kind of overkill I support.', null, now() - interval '259812 seconds');
     values ('642e799a-f991-4e8f-91dd-bfd5c11f695c', '1cba5d73-bfe2-49d7-bf9c-38d9789ee432', 'd91a02cc-8255-465a-bc52-be04a883f810', 'The butterfly placement is perfect. Did you stop the crack first or just let the key hold it?', null, now() - interval '235438 seconds');
     values ('e160de7f-dc0d-4534-8a2c-567fb5f9fc97', '1cba5d73-bfe2-49d7-bf9c-38d9789ee432', '62531dae-f44b-4748-a0d9-0bada8b21385', 'Drilled a tiny stop hole at the end of the check, then the key. It hasn''t moved in four months.', '642e799a-f991-4e8f-91dd-bfd5c11f695c', now() - interval '206954 seconds');
     values ('976adafc-34a0-4bae-aad5-69d748709d2c', '1cba5d73-bfe2-49d7-bf9c-38d9789ee432', '0f34f5c2-dc1a-4171-8687-3ee6cc4bd5fc', 'Please do share the cut list. My wife has been asking for exactly this for the entryway.', null, now() - interval '175423 seconds');
     values ('5b6f29b3-c0fa-44d5-8b7f-eff0c9c94a5f', '1cba5d73-bfe2-49d7-bf9c-38d9789ee432', '62531dae-f44b-4748-a0d9-0bada8b21385', 'Cut list: top 42 x 13 x 1-5/8, legs 1-3/4 square at 30, aprons 3/4 x 4. I''ll post a drawing tonight.', null, now() - interval '141413 seconds');
     values ('333da813-47b4-4c2a-bac9-76cfbaf2f266', '1cba5d73-bfe2-49d7-bf9c-38d9789ee432', '2665ed2d-dce2-4852-b1f1-e64c9c92ae08', 'Ninety year old fir going this dark is wild. Did you plane off the patina on top or keep some?', null, now() - interval '105287 seconds');
     values ('4c921d70-ec95-4e68-9af3-9595cc63e583', '1cba5d73-bfe2-49d7-bf9c-38d9789ee432', '62531dae-f44b-4748-a0d9-0bada8b21385', 'Kept it. Light scrape and a hand sand to 220. Planing would have lost the whole story.', '333da813-47b4-4c2a-bac9-76cfbaf2f266', now() - interval '67302 seconds');
     select '9f40d966-8a90-45fc-b7d3-4861f5918e43', id, '391da3b7-e0f9-42b8-9e58-30c08eae11df', 'Spalted maple bowl, 11 inch', 'Rough turned this last autumn and it finally came back down to moisture. Finish turned it on Saturday. Wall is about 5/16. The spalting was less dramatic than I''d hoped on the inside but the rim is lovely. Walnut oil and', false, false, now() - interval '120960 seconds', now() - interval '120960 seconds'
